道去哪里找靠谱达人、不会筛选、怕投钱没效果！  要么乱找大博主溢价严重，要么找素人数据虚假、带不动货，白白浪","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7654111471715343871","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7654111471715343871","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0127","question_id":"CQ-Q0127","citation_id":"smp-4482c91ad5c549c6b05e85d2dcf3637c:10","title":"达人邀约全流程分享：用数据筛选高质量达人，学会直接照搬 #达人邀约 #tiktok跨境电商 #跨境电商 #达人建联 #proboost","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660324114250386738","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660324114250386738","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0127","question_id":"CQ-Q0127","citation_id":"smp-4482c91ad5c549c6b05e85d2dcf3637c:11","title":"网红营销手段_选品投放合作方式全解析_火烈鸟站长知识库","raw_url":"https://huolieniao.cc/seo/77030356201/shouduan.html","normalized_url":"https://huolieniao.cc/seo/77030356201/shouduan.html","host":"huolieniao.cc","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0127","question_id":"CQ-Q0127","citation_id":"smp-4482c91ad5c549c6b05e85d2dcf3637c:12","title":"巨量星图短直联动产品介绍-星图营销服务平台","raw_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/142728","normalized_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/142728","host":"www.xingtu.cn","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0127","question_id":"CQ-Q0127","citation_id":"smp-4482c91ad5c549c6b05e85d2dcf3637c:13","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0127","question_id":"CQ-Q0127","citation_id":"smp-4482c91